-# Reality-Checker Verification Packet: KANBA-96 (KB-P5-09)
-
-## Ticket Metadata
-- Ticket ID: `KANBA-96`
-- Spec Key: `KB-P5-09`
-- Title: `[Phase 5 / Web] Surgical right-click (contextmenu) accept matrix: all 6 rows of S9.2 incl. 28px radius, spelling node detection & Shift escape`
